{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>三星電子今日正式發佈了旗下全新旗艦級移動圖像傳感器——</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/dcf969ffdf9c6fa.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>作為一款擁有2億像素的重磅產品，</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/4c617e5390c7a52.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>此外，該傳感器還支持16-bit HDR技術，即便在複雜光線環境中也能有效抑制噪點，輸出更加純淨的高質量畫面。在變焦體驗方面，</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/a68bd7de434d959.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>在視頻拍攝與光學結構方面，</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"image.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/a89bd022e61faea.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/dcf969ffdf9c6fa.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>作為一款擁有2億像素的重磅產品，</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/4c617e5390c7a52.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0807/a68bd7de434d959.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>在視頻拍攝與光學結構方面，</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.696178+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":7,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}